1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,799
How Do You Feel? Feelings with Mimo!

2
00:00:05,099 --> 00:00:08,838
Mimo: Hi friends! Today we're learning about feelings!

3
00:00:09,138 --> 00:00:17,702
Mimo: Feelings are what we feel inside. Sometimes we feel happy, and sometimes we feel sad. And that's okay!

4
00:00:18,002 --> 00:00:20,977
Lulu: Let's find out about all the different feelings!

5
00:00:22,456 --> 00:00:25,342
Pip: Look! I got an ice cream! I feel so...

6
00:00:26,942 --> 00:00:28,431
Pip: Happy! Hooray!

7
00:00:28,731 --> 00:00:33,089
Mimo: When we're happy, we smile! Can you show me your happy smile?

8
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:38,664
Pip: Oh no! I dropped my ice cream. Now I feel...

9
00:00:40,964 --> 00:00:41,890
Pip: Sad.

10
00:00:42,189 --> 00:00:48,065
Mimo: When we're sad, we might cry. And that's okay. Can you make a sad face?

11
00:00:51,795 --> 00:00:55,264
Lulu: Pip, do you want a hug? Hugs help when we're sad.

12
00:00:55,564 --> 00:00:58,922
Pip: Yes, please! Thank you, Lulu. I feel a little better.

13
00:01:00,744 --> 00:01:03,068
Bruno: I'm building a tower with my blocks!

14
00:01:03,368 --> 00:01:05,589
Bruno: My tower fell down! I feel...

15
00:01:07,089 --> 00:01:08,647
Bruno: Angry! Grrr!

16
00:01:08,947 --> 00:01:15,589
Mimo: When we're angry, we feel hot and grumpy. Can you make an angry face? Grrr!

17
00:01:19,167 --> 00:01:25,584
Mimo: Bruno, when I feel angry, I take a deep breath. Breathe in... and breathe out.

18
00:01:27,884 --> 00:01:30,441
Bruno: Ahh. That helps! Let's build it again together!

19
00:01:32,341 --> 00:01:34,695
Lulu: What was that big noise? I feel...

20
00:01:34,995 --> 00:01:35,963
Lulu: Scared!

21
00:01:36,263 --> 00:01:41,175
Mimo: When we're scared, we might shake and hide. Can you make a scared face?

22
00:01:43,075 --> 00:01:45,527
Bruno: Sorry! That was just my tummy rumbling!

23
00:01:47,827 --> 00:01:50,438
Lulu: Phew! I'm not scared anymore.

24
00:01:52,390 --> 00:01:54,610
Hoot: Hoo hoo! I have a present for everybody!

25
00:01:55,810 --> 00:01:58,407
Mimo: Wow! We feel surprised!

26
00:01:58,707 --> 00:02:05,535
Mimo: When we're surprised, our eyes get big and our mouth goes, oh! Can you make a surprised face?

27
00:02:11,235 --> 00:02:13,852
Mimo: All these feelings make me feel...

28
00:02:14,152 --> 00:02:16,150
Mimo: Sleepy! Yawn.

29
00:02:16,450 --> 00:02:21,660
Mimo: When we're sleepy, we yawn and rub our eyes. Can you do a big yawn?

30
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:26,487
Mimo: Let's say all the feelings together!

31
00:02:26,787 --> 00:02:27,635
Pip: Happy!

32
00:02:28,335 --> 00:02:29,080
Pip: Sad!

33
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:30,654
Bruno: Angry!

34
00:02:31,354 --> 00:02:32,322
Lulu: Scared!

35
00:02:33,022 --> 00:02:34,276
Mimo: Surprised!

36
00:02:34,976 --> 00:02:35,803
Hoot: And sleepy!

37
00:02:36,103 --> 00:02:43,726
Mimo: All feelings are okay, friends. And when you have a big feeling, you can always tell somebody who loves you.

38
00:02:44,026 --> 00:02:45,639
Lulu: Or take a big deep breath!

39
00:02:45,939 --> 00:02:46,989
Bruno: Or eat a cookie!

40
00:02:49,289 --> 00:02:54,250
Mimo: Next time, let's learn about the weather! Bye bye, friends!
